{"id":"en_my-daughter-has-three-dads","title":"My Daughter Has Three Dads","titleEn":"My Daughter Has Three Dads","description":"Six years ago, Clara Windsor had a single night with a masked stranger, and a daughter was born from it. Five years on, the child bears an unmistakable resemblance to the Sterling triplets as young boys. A DNA test delivers the startling result that all three brothers are a perfect match. As the men compete to claim the girl as their own, Shen's conniving stepsister works to push Clara away. The deepest revelation, however, concerns Clara herself: she is the Sterling family's true lifesaver, and at last the identity of the child's father comes to light. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-daughter-has-three-dads/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-daughter-has-three-dads/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","Billionaire","Lost Child","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6y92/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-daughter-has-three-dads_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6y92/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-daughter-has-three-dads_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6y92/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-daughter-has-three-dads_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6y92/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-daughter-has-three-dads_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4